      "lines": [
        "$C_n^m+C_n^{m+1}=C_{n+1}^{m+1}.\\qquad(1)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "要证明这个公式，只要将下列两个分式通分：",
        "$C_n^m=\\frac{n(n-1)\\cdots(n-m+1)}{1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdots m}$，",
        "$C_n^{m+1}=\\frac{n(n-1)\\cdots(n-m+1)(n-m)}{1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdots m(m+1)}$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "然后相加：",
        "$\\begin{aligned}C_n^m+C_n^{m+1}&=\\frac{(n(n-1)\\cdots(n-m+1))(m+1)}{1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdots m(m+1)},\\\\↵&{}+\\frac{(n(n-1)\\cdots(n-m+1))(n-m)}{1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdots m(m+1)}\\\\↵&=\\frac{n(n-1)\\cdots(n-m+1)(m+1+n-m)}{1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdots m(m+1)}\\\\↵&=\\frac{(n+1)n(n-1)\\cdots(n-m+1)}{(m+1)!}=C_{n+1}^{m+1}.\\end{aligned}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
